+
+      /* GammaOS experiment (GAMMA_ALUDELAY2 env): try the a7xx-style tighter ALU
+       * delay slots on gen6 too. Turnip defaults gen6 to alu_to_alu=3; if the
+       * Adreno 613 actually tolerates 2 (like the stock blob may schedule), this
+       * removes a nop between dependent ALU ops. Correctness-critical - verified
+       * on device before shipping. */
